              }
            },
            {
              "id": "ldap_injection_tainted_ldapi_from_http_request",
              "name": "LDAP Injection (tainted ldapi from http request)",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "LDAP Injection (tainted ldapi from http request)"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "LDAP injection is a type of injection attack that exploits web-based applications that construct LDAP statements based on user input. In C# applications, this typically involves DirectorySearcher, DirectoryEntry, or similar Active Directory operations. When an application fails to properly sanitize user input before constructing and executing LDAP queries, it creates an opportunity for attackers to inject malicious LDAP statements."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "1. **Escape every interpolated value into LDAP filters** per RFC 4515: replace `\\` `*` `(` `)` `\\0` with `\\5c`, `\\2a`, `\\28`, `\\29`, `\\00`. `Novell.Directory.Ldap` and `System.DirectoryServices.Protocols` do NOT escape for you.\n2. **Use a helper**: `static string EscapeLdapFilter(string s) => string.Concat(s.Select(c => c switch { '\\\\' => \"\\\\5c\", '*' => \"\\\\2a\", '(' => \"\\\\28\", ')' => \"\\\\29\", '\\0' => \"\\\\00\", _ => c.ToString() }));`. Apply to every user-supplied piece.\n3. **For DN composition use the DN escaping rules (RFC 4514)** which differ from filter rules: escape `, + \" \\ < > ;` plus leading/trailing space.\n4. **Bind under a read-only service account** for authentication queries. The bind account should not be able to write, delete, or enumerate sensitive attributes (e.g. `userPassword` hashes).\n5. **Use LDAPS or StartTLS with certificate verification.** Cleartext LDAP exposes credentials. Pin the directory CA via `LdapConnection.SessionOptions.VerifyServerCertificate`.\n6. **Apply rate limiting + lockout** on login endpoints — boolean blind LDAP injection can enumerate users at scale.\n\nPriority: IMMEDIATE"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-90",
                  "OWASP/A03:2021"
                ],
                "precision": "medium",
                "security-severity": "5",
                "cwe": "CWE-90",
                "owasp": "A03:2021 - Injection"
              }
            },
